            <Value>Ensure that cryptographically strong client id, client secret are used in Identity Server. Refer:
&lt;a href="https://aka.ms/tmtcrypto#client-server"&gt;https://aka.ms/tmtcrypto#client-server&lt;/a&gt;</Value>
