          <Id>SDLPhase</Id>
          <AttributeType>1</AttributeType>
        </ThreatMetaDatum>
        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>Steps</Name>
          <Label>Steps</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Ensure that cryptographically strong client ID, client secret are used in Identity Server. The following guidelines should be used while generating a client ID and secret: Generate a random GUID as the client ID Generate a cryptographically random 256-bit key as the secret</Value>
