      <Category>T</Category>
      <Description>An adversary may spread malware, steal or tamper data due to lack of endpoint protection on devices. Scenarios such as stealing a user's laptop and extracting data from hard disk, luring users to install malware, exploit unpatched OS etc. </Description>
      <PropertiesMetaData>
