        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>PossibleMitigations</Name>
          <Label>Possible Mitigation(s)</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Pin and review dependencies; do not run an agent inside a freshly-pulled untrusted codebase without sandboxing. Treat third-party content (dependencies, web pages, issue trackers) as untrusted input to the agent, distinct from the developer's instructions. Surface diff previews for every file change before applying. Do not let the agent consume web content into its context without an explicit per-fetch confirmation in sensitive workflows.</Value>
          </Values>
          <Description>List of possbile mitigations.</Description>
          <Id>PossibleMitigations</Id>
