      <Id>TH34</Id>
      <ShortTitle>An adversary can deny actions on Cloud Gateway due to lack of auditing</ShortTitle>
      <Category>R</Category>
      <Description>An adversary may perform actions such as spoofing attempts, unauthorized access etc. on Cloud gateway. It is important to monitor these attempts so that adversary cannot deny these actions</Description>
      <PropertiesMetaData>
        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>UserThreatShortDescription</Name>
          <Label>Short Description</Label>
          <HideFromUI>true</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
