      <Id>TH77</Id>
      <ShortTitle>An adversary can deny actions on Azure App Service due to lack of auditing</ShortTitle>
      <Category>R</Category>
      <Description>Proper logging of all security events and user actions builds traceability in a system and denies any possible repudiation issues. In the absence of proper auditing and logging controls, it would become impossible to implement any accountability in a system. </Description>
      <PropertiesMetaData>
        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>UserThreatShortDescription</Name>
          <Label>Short Description</Label>
