          <Values>
            <Value>Ensure that administrative interfaces are appropriately locked down. Refer: &lt;a href="https://aka.ms/tmtauthn#admin-interface-lockdown"&gt;
https://aka.ms/tmtauthn#admin-interface-lockdown&lt;/a&gt;</Value>
          </Values>
