          <Label>Steps</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>For each generative media flow, document whether tenant-specific fine-tuning is in use, the isolation guarantee, and the content/IP-filter applied to generated output before downstream use.</Value>
