          <Name>Steps</Name>
          <Label>Steps</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>List the connections in each Data Factory workspace, the scope of access each grants, and the pipelines that reference them. Confirm scope matches the minimum required across consumers.</Value>
