          <Values>
            <Value>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/onelake/onelake-shortcuts</Value>
          </Values>
          <Description>Link to documentation</Description>
          <Id>Documentation</Id>
          <AttributeType>0</AttributeType>
        </ThreatMetaDatum>
        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>Steps</Name>
          <Label>Steps</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>List each shortcut in scope, its target storage location, the credential mechanism, and the data classification on each side. Confirm shortcut creation is governed and that targets comply with the workspace's residency requirements.</Value>
