          <Label>Steps</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>List storage accounts and their network and public-access configuration. Identify any anonymous containers and confirm they intentionally hold public content. Apply Azure Policy to prevent regression.</Value>
