        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>PossibleMitigations</Name>
          <Label>Possible Mitigation(s)</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Set default link types to 'specific people' at tenant and site level. Restrict 'anyone with link' to specific sites where it is required. For sites containing sensitive content, enable Sensitivity Labels with auto-labeling and conditional sharing restrictions. Audit external sharing events through Microsoft Purview audit. Train content owners on the implications of each link type.</Value>
          </Values>
          <Description>List of possbile mitigations.</Description>
