          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Applications that depend on a single LLM endpoint inherit that endpoint's availability: per-tenant rate limits, regional quota exhaustion, model retirement on a vendor-controlled schedule, or temporary provider outages will halt the application's AI features. Recovery often requires code changes (new model name, new provider SDK) that cannot be deployed during the incident.</Value>
          </Values>
          <Id>22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222</Id>
          <AttributeType>0</AttributeType>
