          <Id>Documentation</Id>
          <AttributeType>0</AttributeType>
        </ThreatMetaDatum>
        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>Steps</Name>
          <Label>Steps</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>List every IAM role, service principal, or workspace identity granted access to the AI platform. For each, document the scope (project, account, model, dataset), and confirm it matches the consumer's actual need.</Value>
